{
  "_comment": "敏感读取 API 的『待抽取目标』。这里只写类名与方法名；**描述符不手写**，由 extract_android_apis.py 从本机 android.jar 用 javap -s 抽取（这是本库 source_verified 的唯一来源）。抽不到的目标准确落到 build/api_missing.json 作为探测 TODO，不编造签名。",
  "android_version": "36",
  "select_help": "select: zero_arg=只取无参重载; one_int_arg=只取单 int 参重载; all=全部重载",
  "targets": [
    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getDeviceId", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "imei", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "已废弃但长期可用；部分版本返回 null，读取成功以非空判定。"},
    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getImei", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "imei", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "API 26+ 的替代入口。"},
    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getSubscriberId", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "imsi", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"}},

    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getLine1Number", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "phone_number", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "返回本机号码；空串/ null 不构成读取成功。"},

    {"class_name": "android.location.LocationManager", "method_name": "getLastKnownLocation", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": null, "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "provider_arg", "arg_index": 0,
                     "map": {"gps": "precise_location", "network": "coarse_location",
                             "fused": "coarse_location", "passive": "coarse_location"},
                     "unmapped": "ignore"},
     "note": "按 provider 实参分派精确/粗略。"},
    {"class_name": "android.location.LocationManager", "method_name": "requestLocationUpdates", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": null, "api_role": "observe",
     "observation": {"kind": "provider_arg", "arg_index": 0,
                     "map": {"gps": "precise_location", "network": "coarse_location",
                             "fused": "coarse_location", "passive": "coarse_location"},
                     "unmapped": "ignore"},
     "note": "订阅本身不等于拿到定位；如实记录为 observe，结论沿用 observed 上限。"},

    {"class_name": "android.location.Location", "method_name": "getLatitude", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "precise_location", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "定位**取值点**。requestLocationUpdates 只证明订阅；应用真正使用坐标时必经 getLatitude/getLongitude，在此记 obtained。"},
    {"class_name": "android.location.Location", "method_name": "getLongitude", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "precise_location", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "与 getLatitude 成对；任一被调用即说明应用读到了定位值。"},
    {"class_name": "android.location.Location", "method_name": "getSpeed", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "precise_location", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "速度计/导航类应用的典型取值点（2026-11-15 实测：Roam 只调 updateLocation，UI 用 getSpeed 渲染）。"},
    {"class_name": "android.location.Location", "method_name": "getAccuracy", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "precise_location", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "精度也是定位信息的一部分（Blue Square 界面直接展示 accuracy）。"},

    {"class_name": "android.net.wifi.WifiInfo", "method_name": "getMacAddress", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "mac_address", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "Android 6+ 起真实 MAC 常被固定值替换，仍按读取行为记录。"},

    {"class_name": "android.content.ContentResolver", "method_name": "query", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": null, "api_role": "query",
     "observation": {"kind": "content_uri", "arg_index": 0, "match": "prefix",
                     "map": [{"prefix": "content://com.android.contacts", "data_type": "contacts"},
                             {"prefix": "content://contacts", "data_type": "contacts"},
                             {"prefix": "content://call_log", "data_type": "call_log"},
                             {"prefix": "content://sms", "data_type": "sms"},
                             {"prefix": "content://mms", "data_type": "sms"},
                             {"prefix": "content://com.android.calendar", "data_type": "calendar"},
                             {"prefix": "content://media/external/images", "data_type": "media_images"},
                             {"prefix": "content://media/external/video", "data_type": "media_images"},
                             {"prefix": "content://media/external/audio", "data_type": "media_images"}],
                     "unmapped": "ignore"},
     "note": "同一 API 按 URI 分派多个数据类别；未映射 URI（如插件自定义 provider）忽略并计数。"},

    {"class_name": "android.content.ClipboardManager", "method_name": "getPrimaryClip", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "clipboard", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "记录是否非空与条目数；不落剪贴板正文（正文可能含凭据）。"},
    {"class_name": "android.content.ClipboardManager", "method_name": "getText", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "clipboard", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"}},

    {"class_name": "android.content.pm.PackageManager", "method_name": "getInstalledPackages", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "installed_apps", "api_role": "query",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "count_only"},
     "note": "只记录返回条目数，不落全量包名。"},
    {"class_name": "android.content.pm.PackageManager", "method_name": "getInstalledApplications", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "installed_apps", "api_role": "query",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "count_only"}},

    {"class_name": "android.accounts.AccountManager", "method_name": "getAccounts", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "accounts", "api_role": "query",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "count_only"},
     "note": "只记录账户数，不落账户名。"},
    {"class_name": "android.accounts.AccountManager", "method_name": "getAccountsByType", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "accounts", "api_role": "query",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "count_only"}},

    {"class_name": "android.hardware.SensorManager", "method_name": "registerListener", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "sensor_data", "api_role": "observe",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "按 API 面记录订阅行为；不采传感器数值。"},

    {"class_name": "android.net.wifi.WifiInfo", "method_name": "getSSID", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "wifi_ssid_bssid", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "WiFi 网络名称；可推断用户位置与环境。"},
    {"class_name": "android.net.wifi.WifiInfo", "method_name": "getBSSID", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "wifi_ssid_bssid", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "WiFi 接入点 MAC；可精确定位到具体路由器。"},

    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getNetworkOperatorName", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "sim_info", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "当前网络运营商名称。"},
    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getNetworkOperator", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "sim_info", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "MCC+MNC 编码的运营商标识。"},
    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getSimOperatorName", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "sim_info", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "SIM 卡运营商名称。"},
    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getSimCountryIso", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "sim_info", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "SIM 卡注册国家 ISO 代码。"},
    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getSimSerialNumber", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "sim_info", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "SIM 卡序列号（ICCID）；强设备标识。"},
    {"class_name": "android.telephony.TelephonyManager", "method_name": "getMeid", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "imei", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "MEID（CDMA 设备标识）；API 26+。"},

    {"class_name": "android.os.Build", "method_name": "getSerial", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "device_serial", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "设备序列号；API 26+ 需 READ_PHONE_STATE。"},

    {"class_name": "android.bluetooth.BluetoothAdapter", "method_name": "getAddress", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "bluetooth_info", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "本机蓝牙 MAC 地址；Android 6+ 常返回固定值。"},
    {"class_name": "android.bluetooth.BluetoothAdapter", "method_name": "getName", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "bluetooth_info", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "本机蓝牙名称；用户可自定义。"},
    {"class_name": "android.bluetooth.BluetoothAdapter", "method_name": "getBondedDevices", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "bluetooth_info", "api_role": "query",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "count_only"},
     "note": "已配对蓝牙设备列表；只记录数量。"},

    {"class_name": "java.net.NetworkInterface", "method_name": "getHardwareAddress", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "mac_address", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "return_or_exception"},
     "note": "网络接口硬件地址；可绕过 WifiInfo 限制。"},

    {"class_name": "android.app.usage.UsageStatsManager", "method_name": "queryUsageStats", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "usage_stats", "api_role": "query",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "count_only"},
     "note": "应用使用统计；只记录查询行为与返回条数。"},

    {"class_name": "android.provider.Settings$Secure", "method_name": "getString", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": null, "api_role": "query",
     "observation": {"kind": "string_key_arg", "arg_index": 1,
                     "map": [{"value": "android_id", "data_type": "android_id"},
                             {"value": "bluetooth_name", "data_type": "bluetooth_info"},
                             {"value": "wifi_networks_provisioned", "data_type": "wifi_ssid_bssid"}],
                     "unmapped": "ignore"},
     "note": "扩展 Settings.Secure 的 key 分派；新增蓝牙名称与 WiFi 网络键。"},

    {"class_name": "java.net.NetworkInterface", "method_name": "getInetAddresses", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "ip_address", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "枚举本机网络接口的 IP 地址；只记调用事实（Enumeration 无长度，count_only 会恒为 0），不落具体地址。"},

    {"class_name": "android.hardware.camera2.CameraManager", "method_name": "openCamera", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "camera_capture", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "Camera2 打开摄像头设备。回调里才真正拿到帧，本条目记录「已申请打开」这一事实。"},
    {"class_name": "android.hardware.Camera", "method_name": "open", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "camera_capture", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "已废弃的 Camera1 入口；存量 App 仍在用，保留覆盖。"},

    {"class_name": "android.media.AudioRecord", "method_name": "startRecording", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "microphone_capture", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "开始录音。MediaRecorder.start() 有意不钩：它同时覆盖录像路径，start() 时无法判定音/视频源。"},

    {"class_name": "android.media.projection.MediaProjectionManager", "method_name": "getMediaProjection", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "screen_capture", "api_role": "read",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "拿到屏幕投射句柄（录屏/截屏的前提）。createScreenCaptureIntent 与用户授权不算采集。"},

    {"class_name": "android.hardware.biometrics.BiometricPrompt", "method_name": "authenticate", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "biometric_data", "api_role": "observe",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "发起生物识别认证。模板在 TEE，App 侧只看到通过/失败；本条目记录「发起了识别」。"},
    {"class_name": "android.hardware.fingerprint.FingerprintManager", "method_name": "authenticate", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "biometric_data", "api_role": "observe",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "API 28 前的指纹认证入口，已废弃但存量 App 大量使用。"},
    {"class_name": "android.bluetooth.le.BluetoothLeScanner", "method_name": "startScan", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "bluetooth_info", "api_role": "observe",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "BLE 扫描订阅（2026-11-15 补：胎压/车载配件类应用只用这一条路径）。结果经 ScanCallback 回调投递，本条目只记「发起了扫描」与过滤条件，不采设备列表。"},
    {"class_name": "android.bluetooth.le.BluetoothLeScanner", "method_name": "stopScan", "select": "all",
     "data_type_key": "bluetooth_info", "api_role": "observe",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "停止 BLE 扫描。与 startScan 成对，用来判断扫描持续了多久。"},
    {"class_name": "android.bluetooth.BluetoothAdapter", "method_name": "startDiscovery", "select": "zero_arg",
     "data_type_key": "bluetooth_info", "api_role": "observe",
     "observation": {"kind": "direct", "capture": "args_only"},
     "note": "经典蓝牙发现（API 28 前的做法）。结果经 BroadcastReceiver 投递，同 startScan 只记发起。"}
  ]
}
